hyprmoncfg: hyprmoncfg is a terminal-first monitor configurator and
hyprmoncfg: auto-switching daemon for Hyprland. It provides a text UI for
hyprmoncfg: arranging monitors spatially, saving monitor profiles, and
hyprmoncfg: restoring the best matching profile when displays are added or
hyprmoncfg: removed.
